hed (1.3.0) testing; urgency=medium

  * repl(1): -r follows command-line symlinks once only; do not follow or
    recurse into symlinks discovered while walking (use -R to dereference).
  * repl(1): add -p/--patch[=FILE] to write an undo patch (default
    /tmp/repl-TIMESTAMP.patch).
  * repl(1): add --restore=FILE to reverse a patch written by --patch.

